<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-4">How can we help you?</h1>
        <div class="position-relative">
            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-lg shadow-sm ps-5 rounded-pill"
                placeholder="Search for help articles...">
            <i class="fas fa-search position-absolute top-50 start-0 translate-middle-y ms-3 text-muted"></i>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row g-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 hover-lift">
            <div class="card-body p-4 text-center">
                <div class="icon-circle bg-primary-subtle text-primary mb-3 mx-auto">
                    <i class="fas fa-user-graduate fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold fs-5">Student Guide</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small">Everything you need to know about courses, assignments, and grades.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm rounded-pill px-4">View Guide</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 hover-lift">
            <div class="card-body p-4 text-center">
                <div class="icon-circle bg-success-subtle text-success mb-3 mx-auto">
                    <i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold fs-5">Instructor Guide</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small">Learn how to manage courses, grade submissions, and track progress.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm rounded-pill px-4">View Guide</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 hover-lift">
            <div class="card-body p-4 text-center">
                <div class="icon-circle bg-info-subtle text-info mb-3 mx-auto">
                    <i class="fas fa-laptop-code fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold fs-5">Technical Support</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small">Troubleshoot login issues, platform errors, and connectivity problems.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm rounded-pill px-4">Get Support</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="card border-0 bg-light rounded-4">
            <div class="card-body p-5">
                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h4>
                <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-item bg-transparent">
                        <h2 class="accordion-header">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed bg-transparent shadow-none fw-semibold"
                                type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq1">
                                How do I reset my password?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="faq1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                                You can reset your password by clicking on the "Forgot Password" link on the login page.
                                Follow the instructions sent to your email to create a new password.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion-item bg-transparent">
                        <h2 class="accordion-header">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed bg-transparent shadow-none fw-semibold"
                                type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq2">
                                Can I access courses on mobile?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="faq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                                Yes, EduLMS is fully responsive and can be accessed on any mobile device via the web
                                browser.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion-item bg-transparent">
                        <h2 class="accordion-header">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed bg-transparent shadow-none fw-semibold"
                                type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq3">
                                Who do I contact for billing issues?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="faq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                                For billing inquiries, please reach out to our finance department at finance@edulms.edu
                                or use the contact form on the "Contact Us" page.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>